  "term": "mental retardation",
  "definition": "Mental retardation is an older term for intellectual disability, meaning below-average intellectual functioning that begins during the developmental period. It can have several causes, including genetic problems and harmful events around birth, and IQ scores are often used as part of determining whether the condition is present.",
